# ==============================================================================
# f(x) Studio: Release Promotion Exclusions (.promoteignore)
#
# Rules for pruning development, benchmark, and machine-specific files when
# promoting nightly to the clean public/consumer main branch.
#
# Syntax:
#   - Relative paths or directories from repository root
#   - Wildcard globs supported (e.g. app/scripts/test_*.ts)
#   - Negation supported with ! (e.g. !app/scripts/test_milestones.ts)
#   - Comments (#) and blank lines are ignored
# ==============================================================================

